rdosa\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "كُلُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَتَمَتَّعُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0c716d6057dbf9f66d67.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i uživajte", "en": "and enjoy", "tr": "ve faydalanın", "fr": "et jouissez", "id": "dan nikmatilah", "ur": "اور فائدہ اٹھاؤ", "bn": "এবং ভোগ করো", "fa": "و بهره‌مند شوید"}}, {"text": "قَلِيلًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّكُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّجْرِمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "29:66", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3406.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "That they may disbelieve in that which We have given them, and that they may take their ease. But they will come to know.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Kendilerine verdiklerimize nankörlük etsinler ve safâ sürsünler bakalım! Ama yakında bilecekler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ ناشکری کریں ہماری دی ہوئی نعمت کی اور برتیں۔ تو اب جانا چاہتے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "agar mereka mengingkari nikmat yang telah Kami berikan kepada mereka dan agar mereka (hidup) bersenang-senang (dalam kekafiran). Kelak mereka akan mengetahui (akibat perbuatannya).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِيَكْفُرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِمَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلِيَتَمَتَّعُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/2c455a789501f624ac00.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i da uživaju", "en": "and so that they may enjoy", "tr": "ve faydalansınlar diye", "fr": "et afin qu'ils jouissent", "id